title Component diagram for the Scoring Engine Container container

Container_Boundary(scoring_engine_container, "Scoring Engine Container") {
    Component(Scoring Engine Container, "Scoring Engine Container", "AWS ECS on Fargate, Protocol Buffers", "Screens card-not-present payment authorizations for fraud prior to approval.")
